    <string name="addin_force_dex_compile">Force dex2oat compilation</string>
    <string name="addin_force_dex_compile_desc">Compile apps with dex2oat to reduce runtime CPU and RAM usage. Compilation may take 30 minutes; recompilation needed after system updates!</string>
    <string name="addin_dexopt_helpinfo">Since Android N, apps are no longer fully dex-compiled during installation to save space and speed up installation, causing runtime slowdowns. Enabling "Compile" will use speed mode during installation — installation becomes slower but runtime smoother (~20% faster, no game FPS gain).\n\nFor example, Douyu TV on Oreo: base.odex is only 6.8MB fresh-installed, grows to 103MB after compilation.\n\nHowever, many Chinese apps use hot-update tech — they download and render latest code at runtime, which is the main cause of slow startup. dex2oat doesn\'t help these apps!</string>
    <string name="addin_dex2oat_helplink">https://source.android.com/devices/tech/dalvik/jit-compiler</string>
    <string name="addin_pm_dexopt">App install dex2oat policy</string>
    <string name="addin_pm_dexopt_desc">For Android N+, adjust PackageManager dex2oat policy during install. Requires reset after system updates.</string>
